d a small radius) or a forest cleared for a building. They come back when the scene is restarted.","fullName":"Erase copies","functionType":"Action","group":"Paint","name":"EraseCopies","sentence":"Erase the copies of _PARAM0_ in a circle at _PARAM1_; _PARAM2_ with a radius of _PARAM3_","events":[{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::JsCode","inlineCode":["/** @type {gdjs.CustomRuntimeObject3D} */","const object = objects[0];","const x = eventsFunctionContext.getArgument(\"X\");","const y = eventsFunctionContext.getArgument(\"Y\");","const radius = eventsFunctionContext.getArgument(\"Radius\");","object.__terrainScatter.removeCopies(x, y, radius);"],"parameterObjects":"Object","useStrict":true,"eventsSheetExpanded":false}],"parameters":[{"description":"Object","name":"Object","supplementaryInformation":"Terrain3D::ScatteredModels","type":"object"},{"description":"X position of the center","name":"X","type":"expression"},{"description":"Y position of the center","name":"Y","type":"expression"},{"description":"Radius","name":"Radius","type":"expression"}],"objectGroups":[]},{"description":"the number of copies placed in the area.","fullName":"Number of copies","functionType":"ExpressionAndCondition","group":"Copies","name":"CopyCount","sentence":"the number of copies","events":[{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::JsCode","inlineCode":["/** @type {gdjs.CustomRuntimeObject3D} */","const object = objects[0];","eventsFunctionContext.returnValue = object.__terrainScatter.getCopyCount();"],"parameterObjects":"Object","useStrict":true,"eventsSheetExpanded":false}],"expressionType":{"type":"expression"},"parameters":[{"description":"Object","name":"Object","supplementaryInformation":"Terrain3D::ScatteredModels","type":"object"}],"objectGroups":[]},{"description":"The X position of the base of the copy nearest to a position (the position itself if there is no copy).","fullName":"X position of the nearest copy","functionType":"Expression","group":"Copies","name":"NearestCopyX","sentence":"","events":[{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::JsCode","inlineCode":["/** @type {gdjs.CustomRuntimeObject3D} */","const object = objects[0];","const x = eventsFunctionContext.getArgument(\"X\");","const y = eventsFunctionContext.getArgument(\"Y\");","const copy = object.__terrainScatter.findNearestCopy(x, y);","eventsFunctionContext.returnValue = copy ? copy.x : x;"],"parameterObjects":"Object","useStrict":true,"eventsSheetExpanded":false}],"expressionType":{"type":"expression"},"parameters":[{"description":"Object","name":"Object","supplementaryInformation":"Terrain3D::ScatteredModels","type":"object"},{"description":"X position","name":"X","type":"expression"},{"description":"Y position","name":"Y","type":"expression"}],"objectGroups":[]},{"description":"The Y position of the base of the copy nearest to a position (the position itself if there is no copy).","fullName":"Y position of the nearest copy","functionType":"Expression","group":"Copies","name":"NearestCopyY","sentence":"","events":[{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::JsCode","inlineCode":["/** @type {gdjs.CustomRuntimeObject3D} */","const object = objects[0];","const x = eventsFunctionContext.getArgument(\"X\");","const y = eventsFunctionContext.getArgument(\"Y\");","const copy = object.__terrainScatter.findNearestCopy(x, y);","eventsFunctionContext.returnValue = copy ? copy.y : y;"],"parameterObjects":"Object","useStrict":true,"eventsSheetExpanded":false}],"expressionType":{"type":"expression"},"parameters":[{"description":"Object","name":"Object","supplementaryInformation":"Terrain3D::ScatteredModels","type":"object"},{"description":"X position","name":"X","type":"expression"},{"description":"Y position","name":"Y","type":"expression"}],"objectGroups":[]},{"description":"The Z position of the base of the copy nearest to a position (on the ground).","fullName":"Z position of the nearest copy","functionType":"Expression","group":"Copies","name":"NearestCopyZ","sentence":"","events":[{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::JsCode","inlineCode":["/** @type {gdjs.CustomRuntimeObject3D} */","const object = objects[0];","const x = eventsFunctionContext.getArgument(\"X\");","const y = eventsFunctionContext.getArgument(\"Y\");","const copy = object.__terrainScatter.findNearestCopy(x, y);","eventsFunctionContext.returnValue = copy ? copy.z : object.getZ();"],"parameterObjects":"Object","useStrict":true,"eventsSheetExpanded":false}],"expressionType":{"type":"expression"},"parameters":[{"description":"Object","name":"Object","supplementaryInformation":"Terrain3D::ScatteredModels","type":"object"},{"description":"X position","name":"X","type":"expression"},{"description":"Y position","name":"Y","type":"expression"}],"objectGroups":[]},{"description":"the distance (on X and Y) from a position to the base of the nearest copy. It's a very big number when there is no copy.","fullName":"Distance to the nearest copy","functionType":"ExpressionAndCondition","group":"Copies","name":"NearestCopyDistance","sentence":"the distance from _PARAM1_; _PARAM2_ to the nearest copy","events":[{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::JsCode","inlineCode":["/** @type {gdjs.CustomRuntimeObject3D} */","const object = objects[0];","const x = eventsFunctionContext.getArgument(\"X\");","const y = eventsFunctionContext.getArgument(\"Y\");","const copy = object.__terrainScatter.findNearestCopy(x, y);","eventsFunctionContext.returnValue = copy ? Math.hypot(copy.x - x, copy.y - y) : Number.MAX_VALUE;"],"parameterObjects":"Object","useStrict":true,"eventsSheetExpanded":false}],"expressionType":{"type":"expression"},"parameters":[{"description":"Object","name":"Object","supplementaryInformation":"Terrain3D::ScatteredModels","type":"object"},{"description":"X position","name":"X","type":"expression"},{"description":"Y position","name":"Y","type":"expression"}],"objectGroups":[]}],"eventsFunctionsFolderStructure":{"folderName":"__ROOT","children":[{"functionName":"onCreated"},{"functionName":"onDestroy"},{"functionName":"doStepPostEvents"},{"functionName":"onHotReloading"},{"folderName":"Paint","children":[{"functionName":"AddCopies"},{"functionName":"EraseCopies"}]},{"folderName":"Copies","children":[{"functionName":"CopyCount"},{"functionName":"NearestCopyX"},{"functionName":"NearestCopyY"},{"functionName":"NearestCopyZ"},{"functionName":"NearestCopyDistance"}]}]},"propertyDescriptors":[{"value":"","type":"Resource","label":"3D model","description":"The model copied everywhere (a .glb file). Models standing on the Y axis, like most models of the asset store, are stood up along Z.","group":"Model","extraInformation":["model3D"],"choices":[],"name":"Model"},{"value":"300","type":"Number","unit":"Pixel","label":"Height of a copy","description":"Copies keep the proportions of the model.","group":"Model","name":"Size"},{"value":"0.8","type":"Number","label":"Smallest random scale","description":"Each copy is scaled at random between the smallest and the largest scale.","group":"Model","name":"MinScale"},{"value":"1.2","type":"Number","label":"Largest random scale","group":"Model","name":"MaxScale"},{"value":"true","type":"Boolean","label":"Random rotation","description":"Turn each copy around the Z axis at random.","group":"Model","name":"RandomRotation"},{"value":"255;255;255","type":"Color","label":"Random tint","description":"Each copy is tinted between white and this color, at random. White for no tint.","group":"Model","name":"RandomTint"},{"value":"0.3","type":"Number","label":"Density","description":"The number of copies in a square of 100 x 100 pixels where the density is fully painted (0.3 is about one copy every 180 pixels). Copies never overlap their neighbors much: they are placed at random in a grid.","group":"Placement","name":"Density"},{"value":"1","type":"Number","label":"Seed","description":"Each seed places copies differently.","group":"Placement","name":"Seed"},{"value":"Everywhere","type":"Choice","label":"Copies grow","description":"Everywhere in the area, or only where they are painted with the \"Add copies\" brush (or the edits).","group":"Placement","choices":[{"label":"Everywhere (erase them with the brush)","value":"Everywhere"},{"label":"Only where painted","value":"Painted"}],"name":"Coverage"},{"value":"1","type":"Choice","label":"Grows on terrain layer","description":"On a 3D terrain, copies only grow where this layer is painted, away from its borders (so that trees don't stand on roads painted with another layer). A new terrain has layer 1 painted everywhere.","group":"Ground","choices":[{"label":"Any","value":"0"},{"label":"Layer 1","value":"1"},{"label":"Layer 2","value":"2"},{"label":"Layer 3","value":"3"},{"label":"Layer 4","value":"4"}],"name":"GroundLayer"},{"value":"30","type":"Number","unit":"DegreeAngle","label":"Maximum slope","description":"No copies grow on steeper ground.","group":"Ground","name":"MaxSlope"},{"value":"-100000","type":"Number","unit":"Pixel","label":"Minimum ground Z","description":"No copies grow where the ground is lower (for example, under the water level).","group":"Ground","name":"MinGroundZ"},{"value":"100000","type":"Number","unit":"Pixel","label":"Maximum ground Z","description":"No copies grow where the ground is higher (for example, above the tree line).","group":"Ground","name":"MaxGroundZ"},{"value":"false","type":"Boolean","label":"Trunk collisions","description":"Give each copy a static collision shape around its trunk, for the 3D physics behavior (add it to this object, with the \"Static\" type) and navigation meshes. Without them, these behaviors have no effect on this object.","group":"Collisions","name":"TrunkCollisions"},{"value":"30","type":"Number","unit":"Pixel","label":"Trunk diameter","description":"The diameter of the collision shape of a copy at the height given in \"Height of a copy\" (it is scaled with the copy).","group":"Collisions","name":"TrunkDiameter"},{"value":"8000","type":"Number","unit":"Pixel","label":"Draw distance","description":"Copies shrink and are hidden at this distance from the camera.","group":"Rendering","name":"DrawDistance"},{"value":"true","type":"Boolean","label":"Cast shadows","group":"Rendering","name":"CastShadow"},{"value":"true","type":"Boolean","label":"Receive shadows","group":"Rendering","name":"ReceiveShadow"},{"value":"","type":"MultilineString","label":"Edits","description":"Where copies are added or erased, applied in order, as a JSON list, for example [{\"tool\": \"add\", \"x\": 0.3, \"y\": 0.4, \"radius\": 0.15}, {\"tool\": \"erase\", \"x\": 0.1, \"y\": 0.9, \"toX\": 0.8, \"toY\": 0.2, \"radius\": 0.02}]. Tools: add (density: from 0 to 1, 1 by default, how dense copies are compared to the Density property) and erase. strength (from 0 to 1) makes a stroke lighter. x, y and radius are fractions (0 to 1) of the object size (x is (scene X - object X) / object width). Add toX and toY to paint along a line (a row of trees, a path through a forest). With \"Copies grow: only where painted\", only the added areas have copies. Shown in the scene editor.","group":"Placement","advanced":true,"name":"Edits"},{"value":"","type":"String","label":"Painted data","description":"Written by the brushes of the scene editor, in a compact format not meant to be read or written by hand: use Edits instead. Clear it to go back to the coverage and the edits.","advanced":true,"name":"PaintData"}],"propertiesFolderStructure":{"folderName":"__ROOT","children":[{"folderName":"Model","children":[{"propertyName":"Model"},{"propertyName":"Size"},{"propertyName":"MinScale"},{"propertyName":"MaxScale"},{"propertyName":"RandomRotation"},{"propertyName":"RandomTint"}]},{"folderName":"Placement","children":[{"propertyName":"Density"},{"propertyName":"Seed"},{"propertyName":"Coverage"},{"propertyName":"Edits"}]},{"folderName":"Ground","children":[{"propertyName":"GroundLayer"},{"propertyName":"MaxSlope"},{"propertyName":"MinGroundZ"},{"propertyName":"MaxGroundZ"}]},{"folderName":"Collisions","children":[{"propertyName":"TrunkCollisions"},{"propertyName":"TrunkDiameter"}]},{"folderName":"Rendering","children":[{"propertyName":"DrawDistance"},{"propertyName":"CastShadow"},{"propertyName":"ReceiveShadow"}]},{"propertyName":"PaintData"}]},"variants":[]}]}],"externalLayouts":[]}